WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:05.710
This is a regulated data platform on AWS,
recorded live.

2
00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:11.580
A change that would make the warehouse
public fails the policy gate before it

3
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:12.200
can merge.

4
00:00:14.184 --> 00:00:19.464
Records stream in through Firehose, land
in an encrypted lake, and load into

5
00:00:19.464 --> 00:00:21.944
Redshift on a Step Functions pipeline.

6
00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:28.708
A read-only user can query them.
When they try to delete, Redshift refuses.

7
00:00:30.552 --> 00:00:35.382
We failed it over to a second region.
The warm standby held every event

8
00:00:35.382 --> 00:00:38.652
two point one minutes later, with no
data lost.

9
00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:44.496
Then we tore it all down, and the
report found nothing billable left from

10
00:00:44.496 --> 00:00:45.086
the demo.

11
00:00:47.168 --> 00:00:51.638
Infinitech's Regulated Data Platform.
Watch the full walkthrough.
